body=sub('Good information has a paper trail.','See what updates automatically, what is editorial, and when the underlying data was checked.','Sources & methodology')+f'''<section class="section"><div class="wrap article"><h2>What this resource covers</h2><p>{N[0]} is a focused consumer guide for adults in San Jose and the South Bay. The publication covers local culture and maintains practical reference tools.</p><h2>Monthly data refresh</h2><p>The refresh process checks primary references for the publication’s tools. The Terpene Explorer also fetches molecular formula and molecular weight from identified PubChem records. New data is validated before replacing the last successful values. An unavailable or unexpectedly changed source produces a review flag, not a fabricated update.</p><p>Brand histories, aroma descriptions and consumer guides are editorially reviewed separately. Their review dates do not change merely because a source was fetched. No live product stock, strain-specific terpene percentage, license certification or driver location is inferred.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Data</th><th>Latest check</th><th>Date</th></tr></thead><tbody>{checks}</tbody></table></div><h2>Primary references</h2><ul class="source-list">{sources}<li>{a(DCC,'California Department of Cannabis Control: consumer resources ↗')}</li><li>{a('https://www.cannabis.ca.gov/licensees/cannaconnect-compliance-hub/labeling/','California cannabis label requirements ↗')}</li></ul><h2>How to interpret the tool</h2><p>Brand comparison uses documented formats and geographic context. Aroma filtering uses clearly labeled sensory vocabulary. The lab converter calculates only from the values you enter. The cost planner uses only your entered amounts; it never calculates a legal tax determination or guarantees eligibility.</p><h2>Photography & trademarks</h2><p>Downtown San Jose photograph by {a('https://unsplash.com/photos/white-and-blue-dome-building-F3V8LOjJMYc','Mo')}; botanical photograph by {a('https://unsplash.com/photos/green-plant-in-macro-lens-RfT4smmoIrc','Matthew Sichkaruk')}; citrus and herbs by {a('https://unsplash.com/photos/a-lemon-garlic-and-herbs-on-a-black-surface-fQIisY75G-4','Serhii Kalyn')}, used under the Unsplash License. Brand marks identify the subjects of editorial profiles; their owners are not represented as sponsors.</p><h2>Corrections</h2><p>If a current official source differs from this guide, rely on that source for your decision. For an order or product question, contact the retailer directly. Source links make it possible to check the exact reference without relying on an unexplained score.</p></div></section>'''
page('sources.html','Sources, methodology and monthly updates','Source links, data freshness, update methodology and editorial standards for '+N[0]+'.',body,'sources.html')
body=sub('A useful guide, with a clear sponsor.','Built for better-informed cannabis decisions in San Jose.','About')+f'<section class="section"><div class="wrap article"><h2>Why this exists</h2><p>{N[0]} helps adults turn scattered product, retailer and public-reference information into understandable choices. You can use the tools without creating an account. We focus on useful distinctions, clear source links and specific questions to ask before buying.</p><h2>Our sponsor</h2><p>Purple Lotus supports this resource and is visibly credited on every page. Sponsor links are labeled in the site’s link markup. This is a sponsored consumer reference, not an independent review service, government registry or certification body. Brand inclusion does not imply a commercial relationship with that brand.</p><h2>What you will find</h2><p>Each profile and guide has a defined purpose, with source-backed details and clearly separated editorial explanations. Calculators show their assumptions. The tools do not sell cannabis, accept payments, verify identification, diagnose conditions or replace the retailer’s checkout.</p><h2>Local relevance</h2><p>San Jose is the starting point: the directory uses a local retailer’s published brand context, terpene guides support better dispensary questions, and the delivery planner covers named South Bay cities. We avoid presenting every California brand as locally grown.</p><p><a href="sources.html">Read the sources and update policy ↗</a></p></div></section>'
page('about.html','About terpenes','Transparent sponsorship and purpose of '+N[0]+'.',body)
body=sub('Your questions stay yours.','No account, no street-address collection, no order processing.','Privacy')+'<section class="section"><div class="wrap article"><h2>Information you enter</h2><p>Searches, comparison selections, calculator values and checklist choices are processed in your browser. This site does not send those entries to an application server. A saved shortlist may stay in this browser until you clear it. Shared links encode your selected brands, aroma preferences, or city and planning amounts in the URL so another visitor can reopen the same result. Do not include private information. You choose when to copy, download or share a result. It does not ask for a name, identification document, payment details or full delivery address.</p><h2>Hosting and external services</h2><p>The hosting provider may process standard request information such as IP address and browser details to serve and secure the site. Google Fonts supplies the typefaces and may receive ordinary browser request information. Images are served as local site files. No advertising pixels or analytics scripts are included.</p><h2>Links to other websites</h2><p>Opening a retailer, brand or public-reference link takes you to a separate website with its own privacy practices. Orders, age verification and address confirmation happen only on the retailer’s site. This guide does not receive those details.</p><h2>Updates</h2><p>This notice describes the current implementation. If accounts, analytics or saved preferences are added, the notice should be updated before those features are enabled.</p></div></section>'
page('privacy.html','Privacy','How browser-only tools and external links handle information.',body)
